<p><span class="light yellow"></span><b>Warning</b> &ndash; a value is outside a warning threshold, or the species could not be determined. A bioinformatician should look at the sample.</p>
<p><span class="light red"></span><b>Not passed</b> &ndash; a value is outside a critical or fail threshold (e.g. Q30 coverage below the minimum, more than 5 % of another genus). Contact a bioinformatician before the sample is used.</p>
<p>Species and other genus: Kraken2/Bracken on 100&nbsp;000 trimmed reads. Genome size: from the configuration, the genome size list, or a k-mer estimate (jellyfish) when the species is unknown or not listed.</p>
